{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1501","id":4018991814,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vjPLG","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1501","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1501.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1501.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1501","number":1501,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[V1-MS-REVEAL-RUNTIME-HVY-02] Build deterministic MS page locator backfill harness","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1488\n\n## Summary\n\nBuilds the deterministic all-row MS page locator backfill harness for the V1 post-attempt mark-scheme reveal runtime.\n\nThis PR adds:\n- `scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-page-locator-backfill.mjs`\n- focused Jest coverage for the harness and fail-closed validator behavior\n- the generated all-3530 harness artifact\n- the generated validator result artifact\n\n## What Changed\n\nThe harness reads the checked-in question source inventory, MS document inventory, Layer B source spans, Layer C candidate links, full beta runtime source map, and all-3530 runtime read model. It preserves all 3,530 governed question rows and uses deterministic structured evidence plus authorized PDF text-layer extraction to produce page-level locator candidates.\n\nIt normalizes locators with zero-based PDF page index, one-based page number, printed page label, MS component code, source PDF SHA-256, and MS document ID. It preserves ambiguity instead of selecting a guessed page, keeps document-only fallback non-student-display by default, and carries same-page exposure warning metadata.\n\nThe generated harness summary is:\n- total governed rows: 3,530\n- existing page locators preserved: 47\n- deterministic page backfills: 862\n- remaining document-only rows: 2,609\n- ambiguous rows preserved: 12\n- same-page warning missing count: 0\n- generated screenshot count: 0\n- external OCR/VLM/model call count: 0\n\n## Boundaries\n\nNo screenshots, crops, OCR, VLM, external model calls, Supabase mutations, RAG reindexing, vector mutations, or frontend integration were performed. Page text indexes store hashes only, not full mark-scheme text, and explicitly report `ocr_used: false` and `external_model_used: false`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` passed with warnings only for branch naming and local branch ahead before push; worktree clean after commit.\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-page-locator-backfill.mjs` passed.\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules /home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-page-locator-backfill.test.js` passed.\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-page-locator-backfill.mjs` passed and regenerated validator status `pass`.\n- Validator artifact check confirmed `validator_status: pass`, `check_fail_count: 0`, and `errors: 0`.\n- `git status --short -- '*.png' '*.jpg' '*.jpeg' '*.webp' '*.pdf'` showed no new image/PDF artifacts.\n\nESLint on the new files could not run in this worktree because local `node_modules` is absent and `eslint.config.js` imports `@eslint/js` from the worktree-local dependency tree. The focused syntax and Jest checks above were run with the shared installed tool path.\n","created_at":"2026-07-09T03:03:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T03:21:36Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T03:21:36Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T03:21:35Z","merge_commit_sha":"0c01dc64c548b098eb7a0c159111de410ae6b5fa","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1501/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1501/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1501/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/45548296bc89c93bc66831db4e8f0a77a9e0646e","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1488","ref":"feat/issue-1488","sha":"45548296bc89c93bc66831db4e8f0a77a9e0646e","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use